      "claim": {
        "claim_id": "claim_de9c1c7d770c764af8ed687c5c92978d35a18bcfe55b8a989415e2b0917938d9",
        "document_id": "realm",
        "facet": "method",
        "statement": "REALM使用检索增强的语言模型预训练方法，通过优化语言模型的困惑度来训练检索器。",
        "citation": {
          "chunk_id": "chunk_809535800bc7f2e4682e21fd18982fd7a6bc843a53145a892bffed43986ca4e6",
          "char_start": 0,
          "char_end": 419,
          "quote": "Learning this model end-to-end requires\nbackpropagating through a retrieval step that considers an\nentire corpus of textual knowledge, as shown in Figure 1.\nThe key intuition of REALM is to train the retriever us-\ning a performance-based signal from unsupervised text:\na retrieval that improves the language model’s perplex-\nity is helpful and should be rewarded, while an un-\ninformative retrieval should be penalized."
